  "hints": [
    "Old requests leave the window in the same order they arrived.",
    "A queue of timestamps works: add at the back, drop from the front.",
    "For each t, append t, then pop from the front while the front is < t - 3000. The queue length is the answer for t. collections.deque gives O(1) pops from the left."
  ],
